ura","textMapHash":2906386234,"text":"But you are so powerful that I would have believed it even if you claimed to have defeated a giant dragon...","nextNodeIds":[220290307]},{"nodeId":220290307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1742323034,"text":"Actually, I have defeated giant dragons...","nextNodeIds":[220290308]},{"nodeId":220290308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"Asakura","textMapHash":947426314,"text":"Hahaha... I believe you, of course. Thank you for training with me. I will remember what I have learned from this match.","nextNodeIds":[220290309]},{"nodeId":220290309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"Asakura","textMapHash":41458730,"text":"If you do not mind, please come and practice with me often from now on. Having a strong warrior such as yourself as my training partner... I am sure that I will complete that deed soon.","nextNodeIds":[220290310]},{"nodeId":220290310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":145345826,"text":"\"That deed\"?","nextNodeIds":[220290311]},{"nodeId":220290311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"Asakura","textMapHash":3863306498,"text":"Ahem... It's just a little wish I have on my mind. Thank you for your help. Please take these as payment.","nextNodeIds":[220290312]},{"nodeId":220290312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"Asakura","textMapHash":3716277506,"text":"Now, I need to go back and take a break. Your moves were most mighty indeed...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220290304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":174344266,"text":"Sorry, I didn't control my strength back then...","nextNodeIds":[220290305]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2202903,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":[